    "description_html": "<div>\n<div>\n<p>Discover the perfect blend of affordability and style with our Derby Ballpoint Pens. These push-button plastic ballpens feature a sleek white barrel and a vibrant colored clip, making them an excellent choice for budget-conscious customers.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Affordable and Stylish</strong>: Enjoy great value for money with a pen that combines functionality and style.</li>\n<li><strong>Wide Range of Colors</strong>: Choose from a selection of clip colors to match your brand or personal preference.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-Color, High-Resolution Digital Printing</strong>: Showcase your logo or message with a generous digital print area of 60 x 6mm, ensuring your brand stands out in vibrant, high-resolution color.</li>\n<li><strong>Smooth Writing</strong>: Equipped with black ink for a classic and professional writing experience.</li>\n<li><strong>Push-Button Design</strong>: Convenient push-top mechanism for effortless use.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Choose Our Derby Ballpoint Pens?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup costs.</li>\n<li><strong>No Design Fees</strong>: Enjoy the freedom to create without worrying about design charges.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Delivery</strong>: Get your pens delivered to your doorstep at no extra cost.</li>\n<li><strong>Perfect for Customers on a Budget</strong>: These pens offer excellent value without compromising on quality.</li>\n<li><strong>Multiple Colors to Choose From</strong>: Customize your pen with a variety of clip colors to suit your needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Derby Ballpoint Pens Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Elevate your promotional efforts with a pen that combines affordability, style, and customization. Customize your pen with your logo and text, and make a lasting impression. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and add these budget-friendly pens to your collection!</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
